window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Who’s afraid of the Big Bad Wolf?</p> <p>Me. I am very much afraid of the Big Bad Wolf, like any human with a healthy sense of self-preservation would be.</p> <p>I miss the days when wolves were just animals in the forest rather than a thing people turn into, but thanks to Frank, this is the world I live in now.</p> <p>The blinders are off, and the world is nothing like I thought it was.</p> <p>Nate, Gabriel and Brooks fought to keep me in the dark for my own protection. Frank may have won that battle, but I’m going to win the war.</p> <p><i>Seeing Red is book two in the Little Red Duet. It is a medium burn WhyChoose romance, loosely inspired by Little Red Riding Hood, for listeners age 18+</i></p>"; 
